;s 2 grids. In 2025, July to August came in at 40% of normal and August to September at 49% on the middle of the grids. Both grids had their driest year in 1963, with grid 24498 at 69% and grid 24798 at 71%. The preliminary estimate for grid 24498 puts August to September 2026 at 185.8, an estimate that can differ from the final index.</p>"}
